      },
      "text": "Barbara Cassin (ed.), *Vocabulaire européen des philosophies: Dictionnaire des intraduisibles* (2004; English: *Dictionary of Untranslatables*, trans. ed. Apter et al., 2014):"
    },
    {
      "id": "06-UNTRANSLATABILITY.md#007",
      "path": [
        "06-UNTRANSLATABILITY.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
