      "text": "EXPERIMENTAL FINDING (Winawer et al. 2007):\n  Russian speakers are faster at discriminating\n  colors that cross the goluboy/siniy boundary\n  than English speakers.\n  For colors within one Russian category:\n  no advantage over English speakers."
