      "text": "TRANSLATION IMPLICATION:\n  Translating Nabokov's use of \"siniy\" as \"blue\" loses\n  the precision. \"Dark blue\" may be the best English\n  option, but it's analytical (two words, one is a\n  modifier) where the Russian is lexical (one word,\n  basic-level category)."
